# Ice Project - Full Lifecycle Demo
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Create a new Ice Project (London Gala)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mayfair Gala Neptune Sculpture",
  "description": "4-meter Neptune centerpiece for annual charity gala",
  "latitude": 51.5074,
  "longitude": -0.1278,
  "venueName": "The Savoy Grand Ballroom",
  "venueType": "INDOOR_COOLED",
  "indoorCoolingOffset": 9.0,
  "iceType": "CLEAR",
  "sculptureVolumeLiters": 480.0,
  "eventStartTime": "2026-08-20T19:00:00",
  "eventEndTime": "2026-08-20T23:30:00",
  "coolingEquipments": [
    { "equipmentType": "FAN", "quantity": 2 },
    { "equipmentType": "DRY_ICE_BOOSTER", "quantity": 3 },
    { "equipmentType": "DRIP_TRAY", "quantity": 4 }
  ]
}

### 2. Create a high-heat Dubai outdoor project
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects

{
  "name": "Dubai Marina Seafood Buffet Display",
  "description": "12-piece chilled seafoodd display on open-air marina terrace",
  "latitude": 25.2048,
  "longitude": 55.2708,
  "venueName": "One&Only Royal Mirage - Arabian Court Terrace",
  "venueType": "OUTDOOR",
  "indoorCoolingOffset": 0.0,
  "iceType": "WHITE",
  "sculptureVolumeLiters": 120.0,
  "eventStartTime": "2026-08-15T19:00:00",
  "eventEndTime": "2026-08-15T23:30:00",
  "coolingEquipments": [
    { "equipmentType": "FAN", "quantity": 4 },
    { "equipmentType": "DRY_ICE_BOOSTER", "quantity": 5 }
  ]
}

### 3. List all projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects

### 4. Filter projects by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects?status=DRAFT

### 5. Get project by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1

### 6. Update project status: DRAFT -> SCHEDULED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/status?status=SCHEDULED

### 7. Update project status: SCHEDULED -> ACTIVE
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/status?status=ACTIVE

### 8. Add extra cooling equipment to project
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/equipment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "equipmentType": "DRY_ICE_BOOSTER",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 9. Remove cooling equipment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/equipment/1

### 10. Full project update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/projects/1

{
  "name": "Mayfair Gala Neptune Sculpture Updated",
  "description": "4-meter Neptune centerpiece for annual charity gala updated",
  "latitude": 51.5074,
  "longitude": -0.1278,
  "venueName": "The Savoy Grand Ballroom",
  "venueType": "INDOOR_COOLED",
  "indoorCoolingOffset": 10.0,
  "iceType": "CLEAR",
  "sculptureVolumeLiters": 500.0,
  "eventStartTime": "2026-08-20T19:00:00",
  "eventEndTime": "2026-08-20T23:30:00",
  "coolingEquipments": [
    { "equipmentType": "FAN", "quantity": 2 },
    { "equipmentType": "DRY_ICE_BOOSTER", "quantity": 3 },
    { "equipmentType": "DRIP_TRAY", "quantity": 4 }
  ]
}

### 11. Validation error demo
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Missing name and coordinates. Should return 400"
}

### 12. Delete project
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/3